   "lines": [
    "The Harvard rank-list",
    "arrived today; my",
    "marks for last year",
    "were French IV, 51;",
    "Themes 69; Nat. Hist",
    "3, 79; Hist. 87;",
    "Nat. Hist 8, 89; Germ IV,",
    "92; Germ V, 96. My",
    "average is about 85,",
    "10 per cent better than",
    "last year. I am well",
    "satisfied; & my dearest",
    "Father would have",
    "been so pleased.",
    "Funnily enough",
    "I am rather laid",
    "up by an attack",
    "of cholera morbus."
   ],
